  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A cube of side <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;has point charges <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></math> located at each of its vertices except at the origin where the charge is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>.</mo></math> The electric field at the centre of cube is:</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/3c631e3a-b7c2-479c-aadc-893be153d234-image.png\" style=\"width: 270px; height: 225px;\" /></p>",
    "image": null
  },
